# Play compliance reminders

- `targetSdk` / `compileSdk` ≥ 36 for new Play submissions (from 2026-08-31).
- Declare `android:dataExtractionRules` + XML; exclude secrets from backup.
- Edge-to-edge is enforced; handle insets (Material3 Scaffold).
- Prefer Photo Picker over broad media permissions.
- Pure Kotlin is 16 KB-safe; native `.so` needs AGP 8.5.1+ / NDK r28+.
- Data safety form required even when collecting nothing.
- See `docs/research/2026-09-20-android-play-ai-agents.md`.
